# Orc & Troll Starter (1-13): the Valley of Trials, Sen'jin Village and the Echo Isles, Razor Hill and
# Tiragarde Keep, Drygulch Ravine, Thunder Ridge and Skull Rock, and Orgrimmar, for an Orc or Troll duo.
#
# Built into the addon with:
#   python3 addon/tools/guide_build.py addon/guides/orc_troll_starter_1_13.guide --db data/forever.sqlite
#
# Research (November 2026): givers, objectives, prerequisites, race and class masks, drops, timers
# and the places of mobs and objects from the game data (data/forever.sqlite), checked against
# outof.games (Durotar, area 14; Orgrimmar; the quest pages of the unclear ones); Zygor's route as a
# check (there is no RestedXP route below level 21). Wowhead not consulted.
# The quest list is section 3 of addon/guides/horde_1_40_allocation.md, plus Threat from Below
# (99051), which Silverpine Forest (13-15) dropped because it is done here.
#
# Orcs and Trolls both start in the Valley of Trials in this game: there are no Echo Isles starting
# quests (the Echo Isles are visited for Sen'jin Village's quests). Each class gets a letter from
# Gornek: Orcs a Parchment, Trolls a Tablet. The builder's `only` knows classes, not races, so both
# letters of a class are in the guide and the tips say which race skips which.
# Race-only quests: Therzok (1859) is for Orc rogues; the priest quests (5648, 5649, 5654) are for
# Trolls, the only priests here.
#
# Taken here although the allocation gives them to another starter (the starters run side by side,
# so an Orc or Troll never plays those guides, and guide_chain checks each chain on its own):
# - Winds in the Desert (834, Undead Starter), Securing the Lines (835) and A Simmering Storm (97281,
#   Tauren Starter): Rezlak's chain in Durotar. Stormy Potential (97282, ours) needs A Simmering Storm.
# - Call of Fire (1524-1527, Tauren Starter): the shaman Fire Totem chain that follows our Call of
#   Fire (2983), between Far Watch Post and Telf Joolam in Durotar.
# - Meal Appeal, Favorite Food, Rocks to Rests, Yelmak's Medley, Whuut's the Rush (97246, 97249,
#   97326, 97242, 97275, Undead Starter): Orgrimmar errands; the Undead Starter never goes there.
# Added (on no guide's list): the Camping 101 quests of the other professions, A Pain in the Neck
#   (96873), This Is Spinal Axe (96874), Beasts of Thunder Ridge (96875), each for its profession
#   only (`skill`); for Troll priests, In Favor of Spirituality, Garments of Spirituality and Hex of
#   Weakness (5649, 5648, 5654).
# Dropped:
# - Hidden Enemies (5729, 5730): they follow Hidden Enemies in Ragefire Chasm (5728), a dungeon.
# - Exploring the Horde (93739), Journey to the Crossroads (98024): for Windshaper Skyborne only
#   (after Welcome to Azeroth, 95350), per outof.games and the race masks.
# Data notes:
# - Finding the Antidote (813) is marked not in the client, but outof.games lists it in the current
#   game data and Need for a Cure (812) needs it. Kor'ghan offers it only while you have Need for a
#   Cure, which has a 45-minute timer: the guide takes 812, takes 813, abandons 812, and takes 812
#   again from Rhinag at the end, the antidote in the bags.
# - Fire Tar (1525) drops from the Razormane near Far Watch Post, not the Razormane Seers far south
#   the builder picks first; Canvas Scraps (791) from the Kul Tiras Marines and Benedict.
# Left out: Speak with Un'thuwa and Ju-Ju Heaps (1883, 1884, mages at 10: from Orgrimmar back to
#   Sen'jin Village), The Hunter's Path breadcrumbs (6068, 6069: Thotar offers Taming the Beast
#   anyway), Earth Sapta (1463, a repeatable purchase), A Strategic Alliance (785, not in the game).
# The auction house: guide_ah.py finds three items, all for profession quests: the Rough Grinding
#   Stones (96874) and Cured Light Hides (96875), crafted, not dropped, are offered at the first
#   Orgrimmar visit; the Luminous Residue (96873, enchanters) is not, as no city comes before the
#   Echo Isles.
#
# The route: the Valley of Trials (1-6); Ukor and Sen'jin Village, the makrura coast and Kolkar Crag;
# the Ridgeshade spiders and Brakk's camp; Razor Hill, the Razormane Grounds and Tiragarde Keep; the
# south-east coast, the raptors and tigers and the Echo Isles, back to Sen'jin and Razor Hill; class
# quests at 10; Heglan Shadeeye north of Tiragarde Keep; the Razormane camp, Rezlak and Drygulch
# Ravine, the naga coast; Orgrimmar (flight path, the city's errands); Rhinag's venomtails and
# Thunder Ridge; Razor Hill; Margoz, Skull Rock and the sea giant; Razor Hill (shamans to Telf Joolam
# and Far Watch, warriors to Far Watch); Orgrimmar again; Rhinag; and the zeppelin to Tirisfal Glades
# from the tower outside Orgrimmar, where Silverpine Forest (13-15) starts.

guide Orc & Troll Starter (1-13)
races 2 8
levels 1 13
next Silverpine Forest (13-15)

